    updated_at: `2026-11-26T06:12:09Z`,
    source_name: `Jagran`,
    source_url: `https://www.jagran.com/cricket/headlines-baba-aparajith-announced-retirement-from-first-class-cricket-ahead-of-ipl-auction-40448728.html`,
