    id: 97894,
    title: `Shakib, Mustafizur not among Bangladeshi players on 2027 IPL auction list - Al Jazeera`,
    slug: `shakib-mustafizur-not-among-bangladeshi-players-on-2027-ipl-auction-li-2026`,
    original_title: `Shakib, Mustafizur not among Bangladeshi players on 2027 IPL auction list - Al Jazeera`,
    category: `sports`,
