    title: `QUICK TAKE | Why Shashi Tharoor Is Taking the Ramayana Beyond India. Seven Things to Know - Open Magazine`,
    slug: `quick-take-why-shashi-tharoor-is-taking-the-ramayana-beyond-india-seve-2026`,
